# End-to-end EMULATOR test: BIGTREETECH SKR mini E3 v2.0 (STM32F103)
# under Renode in tick mode. Boots real firmware, completes identify +
# clocksync, brings up the full config (4 TMC2209s, 2 software-PWM
# heaters, 2 fans, endstops, 2 thermistors) and round-trips M114/M105.
# See "Per-printer tests" in test/emulator/README.md for the shared
# conventions.
#
# Ground specific to this board:
#   - TMC2209 MULTI-DROP UART: all four drivers share one software-UART
#     bus (PC11 rx / PC10 tx), distinguished by uart_address (0/2/1/3)
#     in the datagram rather than a select-pin mux. Replies are always
#     master-addressed (sync=0x05, addr=0xff) per the TMC datasheet, so
#     renode_hooks.sw_uart serves every address from one shared register
#     file; per-driver IFCNT write-verify still lines up because klippy
#     initialises the drivers sequentially. DUMP_TMC reads addr 0
#     (stepper_x) and addr 3 (extruder), both ends of the range.
#   - Plain (non-adc_scaled) thermistors on ADC1 channel 0 (PA0) and 13
#     (PC3) via stm32_adc_stub.py, which completes klipper's F1
#     SWSTART -> STRT/EOC -> SQR3/DR handshake (upstream Renode's
#     Analog.STM32_ADC does not, so every heater would read temp=0.0).
DICTIONARY stm32f103.dict
CONFIG skr_mini_e3_v2.cfg
EMULATOR skr_mini_e3_v2.fixture.json
REQUIRES_EMULATOR  # deterministic-time lockstep needs the real backend

M114
M105
DUMP_TMC STEPPER=stepper_x
DUMP_TMC STEPPER=extruder

EXPECT_LOG_CONTAINS "Loaded MCU 'mcu'"
EXPECT_LOG_CONTAINS "Configured MCU 'mcu'"
EXPECT_LOG_CONTAINS "DUMP_TMC stepper_x"
EXPECT_LOG_CONTAINS "DUMP_TMC extruder"
EXPECT_LOG_CONTAINS "version=0x21"
EXPECT_LOG_NOT_CONTAINS "failed to init"
EXPECT_LOG_NOT_CONTAINS "Unable to read tmc uart"
EXPECT_LOG_NOT_CONTAINS "Unable to write tmc uart"
EXPECT_LOG_NOT_CONTAINS "Internal error"
EXPECT_LOG_NOT_CONTAINS "Got EOF when reading from device"
EXPECT_LOG_NOT_CONTAINS "failed to init: Timeout"
EXPECT_LOG_NOT_CONTAINS "ADC out of range"
EXPECT_LOG_NOT_CONTAINS "Timer too close"
EXPECT_LOG_NOT_CONTAINS "Rescheduled timer in the past"
EXPECT_LOG_NOT_CONTAINS "Klippy is shutdown"
